<p>The package could not be applied and ESR could not be re-measured. Two hard blocks: my desk is <strong>propose-only</strong>, so I have no right to apply a lift, and the figures supplied contain no post-application ESR, so any "measured post-application" number would be invented. The only ESR in evidence remains <strong>9.0% for 2026-07</strong> (billed 2552.92 USD against effective 2323.03 USD) [qid:6681bdbe]. Realized commitment saving month-to-date is <strong>118.28 USD</strong> on a partial August (through 2026-08-15) [qid:70accc39]; modelled saving is <strong>0.00 by evidence</strong>, because no sizing figure for any lift component exists in the dataset. I am <strong>not</strong> declaring coverage on task #67, for the reason given in the last section.</p>
