<p><strong>The forecast has run low three months in a row.</strong> Variance was -13.3%, -7.6%, -11.2% for May, June and July, worst absolute 13.3%, ladder position "walk" against the 20/15/12 canon [qid:4f560380]. The in-sample winner is seasonal-naive(7) at MAPE 2.60, with a next-30-day point of 2522.11 USD in a band of 2423.70 to 2620.52 [qid:1736e3d2][qid:6507499b]. In-sample fit is good, but the walk-forward record says actuals land above forecast. Any modelled saving expressed as a percentage of forecast will therefore read optimistic.</p>
